{'symbol': 'CARR', 'date': '2022-07-26 11:01:00', 'title': "CALIFORNIA ENERGY COMMISSION SELECTS NORESCO TO DEVELOP NEW ENERGY EFFICIENCY STANDARDS IN SUPPORT OF STATE'S DECARBONIZATION GOALS", 'text': "OAKLAND, CALIF. , JULY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORESCO, A PART OF CARRIER GLOBAL CORPORATION (NYSE: CARR), IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A NEW, THREE-YEAR CONTRACT TO HELP THE CALIFORNIA ENERGY COMMISSION (CEC) DEVELOP AND ADOPT THE STATE'S BUILDING ENERGY CODE FOR 2025."}